# Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA)

## Interactive Elements Must Have Accessible Names

```html
<!-- ❌ Button in a table row – ambiguous label -->
<button (click)="useVersion.emit(v.version)">Verwenden</button>

<!-- ✅ Disambiguated with aria-label -->
<button
  (click)="useVersion.emit(v.version)"
  [attr.aria-label]="'Version ' + v.version + ' verwenden'"
>Verwenden</button>
```

- Icon-only buttons: `aria-label` on `<button>`, `aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"` on SVG
- Inputs: always paired with `<label for="…">` + hint via `aria-describedby`

## Decorative SVGs

```html
<!-- ❌ SVG announced as unlabelled image -->
<svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24">…</svg>

<!-- ✅ Hidden from AT -->
<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="28" height="28">…</svg>
```

## Tables

```html
<!-- ❌ Missing structure -->
<table><tr><th>Version</th>…</tr></table>

<!-- ✅ Full accessible table -->
<table aria-label="Installierte Node.js-Versionen">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th scope="col">Version</th>
      <th scope="col">Status</th>
      <th scope="col">Aktionen</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr [attr.aria-current]="v.active ? 'true' : null">…</tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

## Live Regions for Dynamic Content

```html
<!-- Loading -->
<div aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" class="visually-hidden">
  @if (isLoading()) { Lade Daten … }
</div>

<!-- Errors (assertive = immediate interruption) -->
<div role="alert" aria-live="assertive">
  @if (errorMessage()) { {{ errorMessage() }} }
</div>
```

## Modals

Required attributes on the modal container:
- `role="dialog"` + `aria-modal="true"`
- `aria-labelledby` → `id` on `<h2>`
- `aria-describedby` → `id` on body `<p>`
- `cdkTrapFocus` + `cdkTrapFocusAutoCapture` (Angular CDK)
- Escape key closes via `@HostListener('keydown.escape')`
- Focus returns to trigger element on close

## Keyboard Navigation

- No `tabindex > 0`
- Focus ring never removed without a visible replacement
- All functionality operable via keyboard only

## Visually Hidden Helper

Add to `styles.scss` if not already present:

```scss
.visually-hidden {
  position: absolute;
  width: 1px; height: 1px;
  padding: 0; margin: -1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
  white-space: nowrap;
  border: 0;
}
```
